      "ngram6.vals.bin": "little-endian Float32 joint log10 P for each key",
      "ngram6.gamma.bin": "dense little-endian Float32, 26^5 entries: G6(h) = log10 of the backoff weight gamma_6(h) of 5-letter history h (0 for histories never seen in training)"
